OL,4,BDurham sign Essex all-rounder          
OL,5,BBenkenstein                            
OL,6,GDurham have signed Essex all-rounder   
OL,7,GLuc Benkenstein on a "multi-year"      
OL,8,Gcontract.                              
OL,10,FThe 22-year-old's father Dale played   
OL,11,Ffor the Chester-le-Street side between 
OL,12,F2005 and 2014.                         
OL,14,FEx-England Under-19 international      
OL,15,FBenkenstein made 80 appearances for    
OL,16,FEssex after making his debut aged 16   
OL,17,Fin August 2021.                        
